<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in Cataclysm Classic Pre-Raid BiS. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Icecrown Citadel, Trial of the Crusader, Ulduar, Naxxramas, Obsidian Sanctum, and Eye of Eternity. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c3">Best in Slot Gear for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS in Pre-Raid</span></h2>As a Beast Mastery Hunter your first set as always is reaching your hit cap. Luckily a lot of best in slot pre-raid gear has plenty of hit so you should have no issues at all reaching the hit cap of 961 rating. Also with Cataclysm and the reforging system it is easier than ever. After reaching hit cap you will want to aim for reaching the haste soft cap of 757 haste rating. <br/>
<br/>Luckily with the release of Cataclysm and the new <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=87506/mail-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_enchantarmor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mail Specialization</span></a> ability you should have a much easier time acquiring gear as you will no longer be competing with Warriors and Rogues for gear or having to fight for leather pieces.<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hit Rating - You will want to aim for 8% hit rating, 961 rating as your first primary stat.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Haste Rating - Your next priority is reaching the haste soft cap. At level 85 this 757 haste rating.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Agility - Agility is the next most important stat, and as a Hunter this will be the main base stat.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Critical Strike Rating - Crit Rating comes next after Haste Rating and Agility.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Mastery - Mastery is the lowest priority secondary stat for Beast Mastery Hunters.</div></li></ol>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
