<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Shoulders for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the shoulder slot you have two very close pieces, however <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56419/bloodpetal-mantle">
<img alt="Bloodpetal Mantle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodpetal Mantle</span></a> is the absolute best option for pre-raid so make it your primary focus in this slot. If you happen to get extremely unlucky with the drop and you have spare <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> then you can opt for <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58124/wrap-of-the-valley-glades">
<img alt="Wrap of the Valley Glades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_mail_dungeonmail_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrap of the Valley Glades</span></a> instead.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62346/greater-inscription-of-shattered-crystal">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_goldendraenite_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal</span></a>
