<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Back for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the cloak you will want to aim for <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63473/cloak-of-thredd">
