<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Neck for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the neck you will be using a Jewelcrafted BoE neck. This neck is itemized perfectly, and being the only neck option available with a socket and also being red with a +10 agility bonus it makes this option a no brainer. <br/>
<br/>As a Beast Mastery Hunter you should have Jewelcrafting as one of your professions so farm the materials for this neck as soon as possible.<div class="pad"></div>
