<img alt="Brazen Elementium Medallion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_50.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brazen Elementium Medallion</span></a></td>
