<img alt="Design: Brazen Elementium Medallion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Design: Brazen Elementium Medallion</span></a></td>
