<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Rings for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>For the rings you will want to use <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52348/elementium-destroyers-ring">
<img alt="Elementium Destroyer's Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Destroyer's Ring</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62362/signet-of-the-elder-council">
<img alt="Signet of the Elder Council" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Elder Council</span></a>. As with your neck slot, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52348/elementium-destroyers-ring">
<img alt="Elementium Destroyer's Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Destroyer's Ring</span></a> is a Jewelcrafted BoE with a red gem socket so you will want to farm the materials for this ring at the same time as you are farming for your neck. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62362/signet-of-the-elder-council">
<img alt="Signet of the Elder Council" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Elder Council</span></a> requires exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1135/the-earthen-ring">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Earthen Ring</span></a> which should be easily achievable early on after reaching level 85 assuming your do your daily heroic dungeons with the tabard equipped.<div class="pad"></div>
