<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="melee-weapons-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Melee Weapons for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>As a <span class="c3">Beast Mastery Hunter</span> in Cataclysm you will typically want to always use a 2h weapon and ignore 1h options. The primary and secondary stats you gain from using a 2h weapon will <b>always</b> be better than using two 1h weapons.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65168/rockslicer">
<img alt="Rockslicer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_throwingaxe_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rockslicer</span></a> is the best 2h option for pre-raid. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56325/bertos-staff">
<img alt="Berto's Staff" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Berto's Staff</span></a> is a close second, but considering it is an open world BoE drop it will most likely not be cheap, and you will want to spend your gold on much more important items in other gear slots.<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68134/enchant-2h-weapon-mighty-agility">
<img alt="Enchant 2H Weapon - Mighty Agility" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant 2H Weapon - Mighty Agility</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
