<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="ranged-weapon-for-beast-mastery-hunter-dps">Ranged Weapon for Beast Mastery Hunter DPS</h4>Finally for the ranged weapon and most important gear slot as a Hunter. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56317/amber-messenger">
<img alt="Amber Messenger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bow_1h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amber Messenger</span></a> is the best option for a Beast Mastery Hunter.<br/>
<br/> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56366/lightningflash">
<img alt="Lightningflash" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_firearm_2h_rifle_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightningflash</span></a> is a very close alternative so if it drops and you do not yet have <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56317/amber-messenger">
<img alt="Amber Messenger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bow_1h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amber Messenger</span></a> then definitely pick it up.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Scope</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59594/gnomish-x-ray-scope">
<img alt="Gnomish X-Ray Scope" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_scopea.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gnomish X-Ray Scope</span></a>
